WEBVTT

00:08:28.894 --> 00:08:30.577
and Dolly was an example

00:08:30.577 --> 00:08:33.791
of the first cloning of a mammal

00:08:33.791 --> 00:08:35.739
from an adult cell.

00:08:35.739 --> 00:08:38.544
But I think the even more significant breakthrough

00:08:38.544 --> 00:08:41.466
for the purposes of our discussion today

00:08:41.466 --> 00:08:43.955
was made in 2006 by a Japanese scientist

00:08:43.955 --> 00:08:45.552
called Yamanaka.

00:08:45.552 --> 00:08:46.856
And what Yamaka did,

00:08:46.856 --> 00:08:49.288
in a fantastic form of scientific cookery,

00:08:49.288 --> 00:08:51.326
was he showed that four ingredients,

00:08:51.326 --> 00:08:53.189
just four ingredients,

00:08:53.189 --> 00:08:56.376
could effectively convert any cell, adult cell,

00:08:56.376 --> 00:08:58.618
into a master stem cell.

00:08:58.618 --> 00:09:01.602
And the significance of this is difficult to exaggerate,